  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Democracy and Electoral Processes in Mozambique is a four-year multi-donor project designed to cover the Mozambican Electoral Cycle 2022-2025. The project builds on previous electoral support and lessons learned as Mozambique enters its next electoral cycle, including the run-up to 2023 Municipality Elections and 2024 General Elections.</narrative>
  </description>
